  "description": "OpenAI-compatible hosted inference server over CircleAI.Hosting.InferenceBridge. Endpoints: /v1/chat/completions (SSE streaming), /v1/embeddings, /v1/companion/*, /v1/diagnostics, /v1/healthz, /v1/readyz. JWT and API-key auth out of the box. Ships Dockerfile, systemd unit, and a Windows-service install script. 1.3.3 picks up CircleAI.Inference 1.3.3 — osx-arm64 native payload (libmnnbridge.dylib + libMNN.dylib) added. The server now runs on win-x64, linux-x64, and osx-arm64 without any manual native-lib copying.",
